WEBVTT

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.230
Have you...

00:00:11.050 --> 00:00:12.650
ever fallen...

00:00:13.120 --> 00:00:14.110
in love?

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:59.550
Yamamoto-san Beside Me

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:57.090
What? I don't believe you.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:00.010
Really, it's delicious!

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:01.300
Right, Meguru-chan?

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:06.850
Yeah, I was skeptical at first, but after tasting it I was really surprised how good it was.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:10.310
But you're supposed to put salt on tomatoes when eating them whole.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.560
It's not right to use sugar.

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:15.860
Well, just trick yourself into thinking it's salt and try it at least.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.900
No thanks, I'll pass

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:20.530
Yamamoto, you're surprisingly stubborn.

00:02:20.530 --> 00:02:23.370
It's like you're way too conservation. Not to mention with guys, too.

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.200
What? Guys?

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.290
What do guys have to do with any of this?

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:30.960
Well, you're popular and could go out with anyone.

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:33.420
A message?

00:02:33.420 --> 00:02:34.250
I wonder who it is...

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:36.210
It's Misao.

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:39.630
That's the scary guy who looks like a Yeti, right?

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.590
Yup, we're childhood friends.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:46.180
Hey, is it true that a middle school girl beat him up?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:48.520
What? I didn't hear about anything like that.

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:50.940
Maybe that's why he wants to talk.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:54.940
If he's looking for advice, it has to be about a girl he likes.

00:02:54.940 --> 00:02:57.900
Him? No way!

00:02:57.900 --> 00:02:59.150
You got that right.

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.320
Anyway, Touto's participating in the upcoming match.

00:03:03.320 --> 00:03:06.080
Oh, the fighter you've had your eyes on?

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.040
Misaki-chan, you really like martial arts, don't you?

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:13.790
Really? So you did end up telling him.

00:03:13.790 --> 00:03:16.800
Yeah, but it was really scary...

00:03:17.800 --> 00:03:21.130
Please, stop following me around!

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:25.970
So that's why Beast-kun wasn't there this morning.

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:29.140
If I knew things would turn out this way, I would've just told him sooner.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:31.350
That's great, Ayumi-chan!

00:03:31.350 --> 00:03:33.690
We can finally go home together now.

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.440
Yup.

00:03:34.440 --> 00:03:35.770
Bad news! Bad news!

00:03:35.770 --> 00:03:36.730
Have you girls heard?

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:39.860
Apparently Beast-kun got into a fight, but lost!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.160
You're kidding! Even Beast-kun can lose?

00:03:43.160 --> 00:03:45.830
Yeah, and his opponent was a girl too!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:48.620
Really? I wonder what kind of person she is.

00:03:48.620 --> 00:03:50.500
I want to meet her!

00:03:50.710 --> 00:03:52.460
Anyway, let's go to school!

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:55.380
Ayumi-chan...

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:05.300
Isn't it just another one of Kusuda's lies?

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.310
I'm telling you it's not a lie!

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:12.020
Right? Your brother got beat up by a girl, didn't he?

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:12.560
He did?

00:04:12.890 --> 00:04:15.190
"He did?" Aren't you his brother?

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:18.230
I don't really talk about these things with my brother.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.070
So it is just a rumor.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:23.610
It's impossible for a girl to beat up Zaitsu Misao.

00:04:23.610 --> 00:04:24.910
What the hell, Sogabe?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:27.200
Are you doubting me?!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.290
There's no way I would lie.

00:04:29.290 --> 00:04:31.790
Wasn't that DVD from the other day good?

00:04:31.790 --> 00:04:33.660
Give me a break...

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:38.170
So... Why was it about animals?

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:40.590
I never said anything about actual people...

00:04:40.590 --> 00:04:42.380
Okay, okay! Move out of the way!

00:04:43.010 --> 00:04:44.380
Arihara-san.

00:04:45.510 --> 00:04:47.720
Good morning, Zaitsu-kun.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:49.970
G-Good morning.

00:04:51.560 --> 00:04:55.350
She knocked out my brother in one shot, despite her small body...

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.730
That can't be true, right?

00:04:56.730 --> 00:04:58.560
I imagined it, right?

00:04:58.560 --> 00:05:02.940
Oh no. I won't know what to do if he keeps staring at me like that.

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:06.360
What, what? You two are flirting so early in the morning.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:08.320
So you guys going out after all?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.990
No! It's not like we're together or anything...

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:12.700
I didn't imagine anything!

00:05:12.700 --> 00:05:13.830
Huh?

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:15.000
N-No, it's nothing!

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.460
Anyway, what's up?

00:05:17.960 --> 00:05:21.880
Um... Zaitsu-kun, this is for you.

00:05:22.840 --> 00:05:26.800
I wanted to thanks for taking me to the infirmary yesterday by baking you cookies.

00:05:27.260 --> 00:05:29.050
I fit's okay with you, try some.

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.310
Too burnt. 35 points. Your brother, Yuuji.

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:34.140
It says 35 points.

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:39.110
I'll bake some more after I've practiced, so...

00:05:40.190 --> 00:05:43.610
I can't believe it! That stupid brother!

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:45.240
Ayumi-chan...

00:05:45.740 --> 00:05:47.740
What was that just now?

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:50.700
Man, Zaitsu, you're clueless.

00:05:50.950 --> 00:05:51.660
Huh?

00:05:51.660 --> 00:05:54.330
Why are you so slow?!

00:05:54.330 --> 00:05:56.330
She's pretty much saying she likes you!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.000
No way.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.420
I don't remember Arihara-san confessing to me or anything.

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:06.260
Is your head filled with chestnut cream used in Mont Blancs?!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:08.430
M-Maybe...

00:06:08.430 --> 00:06:09.840
Maybe?

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:12.560
It's obvious that she has feelings for you!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:15.470
You should be happier! Oh, and by the way, go out with her!

00:06:15.470 --> 00:06:17.100
What? Go out with her?

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.940
Because then you can...

00:06:19.100 --> 00:06:23.610
Grope Arihara's body as much as you want!

00:06:23.900 --> 00:06:26.860
Is there anything more envious than that?!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.070
And let me sneak in a grope once in a while too.

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.620
Thinking about girls from our class like that is a bit...

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.000
Bah! Lame!

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.660
That part of you that acts so proper is seriously lame!

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:43.840
You're the only one that doesn't see them that way, right, Sogabe?

00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:45.500
Don't lump me together with you.

00:06:45.800 --> 00:06:48.470
What?! You both don't want to see them?!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.300
We should be more honest with ourselves!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.800
If they're really ugly then it's understandable, but...

00:06:52.800 --> 00:06:55.720
if you were going out with a girl like Arihara, normally-

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.390
I get it, Zaitsu...

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:03.940
Could it be that...

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:08.070
...you have someone you like?

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:09.950
Damn it!

00:07:09.950 --> 00:07:11.910
There is someone! Your face proves it!

00:07:11.910 --> 00:07:14.370
A-Are you guys already going out?

00:07:14.370 --> 00:07:16.830
Is that true, Zaitsu-kun?

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.330
We're not going out...

00:07:18.330 --> 00:07:20.460
But there's a girl you like though, right?

00:07:20.460 --> 00:07:21.580
Who? Who?!

00:07:21.580 --> 00:07:24.670
Tell us, Zaitsu-kun!

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:34.010
I see! I didn't think it would be a high schooler!

00:07:34.010 --> 00:07:35.640
Kusuda-kun, you're too loud!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:40.350
But, man, I don't really understand the older woman thing,

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:44.060
but looking at it this way, it's looking pretty good...

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.610
You're drooling.

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.070
Sogabe should have come.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:52.570
She's coming? Which one?

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:54.240
Which one is it?!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.560
Crap, she noticed me.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:29.780
S-She's amazing!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:31.780
Did you see those boobs?!

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:33.570
Those legs?!

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:37.450
She was looking over here! Don't tell me you're acquainted with her in some way?!

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.080
It's just a one-sided love.

00:08:40.410 --> 00:08:43.790
All right! I'll help out your love!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:47.000
So when it goes well, just let me touch her boob-

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:48.380
No way I would!

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.460
Anyways! Let's make a plan! A plan!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.760
No, it's fine...

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:57.720
Don't worry about it! Let's carefully think of a plan at your house!

00:08:59.390 --> 00:09:02.020
It's not a good time to go to my house though...

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:06.850
I'm home!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:10.690
Welcome back.

00:09:11.280 --> 00:09:14.570
I forgot about Zaitsu's brother...

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.740
He's a friend from my class.

00:09:16.740 --> 00:09:17.450
Welcome.

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.490
A-Actually, I-I think I'll g-go home.

00:09:20.490 --> 00:09:23.700
What're you talking about? You just got here.

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.620
Come on in.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.830
S-Sorry for intruding. T-Than-

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:37.260
That was scary... That was my first time actually seeing your brother, so I freaked out.

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:40.680
Although he looks like that, he's really nice.

00:09:40.680 --> 00:09:45.640
Speaking of which, he had some bandages on. Is that rumor really true then?

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.650
The one about a middle school girl beating him up.

00:09:48.060 --> 00:09:50.020
Why don't you ask him yourself?

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:53.150
You're kidding me, right? I'm too young to die.

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:54.740
You're not going to-

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.650
Huh? What is it?

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.490
Mamoru, you there?

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.280
Are you back yet?

00:10:01.280 --> 00:10:04.330
A w-w-wo-woman's voice!

00:10:04.330 --> 00:10:06.040
Hey, what's the meaning of this?

00:10:06.370 --> 00:10:09.080
Hey, is it okay if i come over?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:09.670
No!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:15.210
Right now, I have a... friend over...

00:10:19.930 --> 00:10:20.930
Hey.

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:25.100
That's why I didn't want to come home.

00:10:28.020 --> 00:10:30.350
I told you no, didn't I?

00:10:30.690 --> 00:10:34.110
Just let me use your room to pass through for a bit!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.740
Oh Mamoru, is this your friend?

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:42.530
Kusuda-kun.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:44.450
Sorry!

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:51.000
Hey, is it true that a girl in middle school beat up Misao?

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:52.960
I don't know...

00:10:53.630 --> 00:10:56.090
Her boobs... Boobs..

00:10:54.340 --> 00:10:56.090
You haven't heard that rumor?

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:57.210
No.

00:10:57.210 --> 00:10:59.720
Then I wonder what he wants to talk about.

00:11:00.090 --> 00:11:04.850
I got a message this morning from Misao saying he wanted me to come over and give him advice on something.

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:08.180
Oh, I see. You came to see my brother...

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.060
Yeah, is Misao here?

00:11:10.810 --> 00:11:11.650
Yeah.

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:13.310
Ok, then I'm going to go talk with him.

00:11:19.740 --> 00:11:23.240
Why were you pretending she was a stranger this entire time?!

00:11:23.240 --> 00:11:25.830
She's your neighbor!

00:11:27.870 --> 00:11:31.830
Saki-nee just sees me as a childhood friend.

00:11:32.080 --> 00:11:34.750
Oh? So you call her Saki-nee...

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:36.710
Yamamoto Misaki.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.840
She's a high school student, so...

00:11:38.840 --> 00:11:39.920
She's 16.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.680
Two years older, huh?!

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.930
High school girls are great!

00:11:45.180 --> 00:11:46.260
What are you doing?!

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:49.270
The feeling of her breasts!

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:51.640
You really are the worst!

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:55.360
Her lingering smell!!

00:11:55.360 --> 00:11:57.270
Thank you very much!

00:12:00.860 --> 00:12:03.780
It's not as good as you think it is, though.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:05.450
Being neighbors, that is.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.160
What's this all of a sudden?

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:09.500
Things may have been different if I were older, but...

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:14.170
she doesn't see me as a man at all because I'm younger.

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:18.840
Saki-nee just thinks of me as a younger brother.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:26.680
So you won't make a move because you don't want to lose that sibling-like relationship.

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:36.770
Here, it's the rice you guys love so much!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.540
I guess it only works when I'm not watching.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:52.000
You look so happy.

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:56.000
Misao, that delicate side of yours really doesn't suit your body's image.

00:12:56.000 --> 00:12:57.790
There's a pretty big gap.

00:12:57.790 --> 00:12:59.250
And you like small animals.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:03.050
You folded the laundry again, didn't you?

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:06.340
Mom's way isn't careful enough.

00:13:06.340 --> 00:13:11.520
But then why won't small animals become attached to me?

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.770
The sparrows are scared and won't even come near me,

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.690
and how many hamsters ended up dying due to stress?

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.270
Yeah...

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.660
I would treat her preciously, though...

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:32.490
What are you getting all red for?

00:13:32.490 --> 00:13:34.410
Ah, nothing!

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:36.370
Your voice is cracking.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:38.920
I guess things like that are just impossible.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:42.550
Why are you being all lonely and depressed?

00:13:42.550 --> 00:13:44.630
All because you lost a fight.

00:13:44.630 --> 00:13:45.550
Huh?

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.630
That's what you wanted advice about, right?

00:13:47.930 --> 00:13:48.800
Yeah...

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:53.770
I'll teach you my secret ultimate winning move, so cheer up!

00:13:53.770 --> 00:13:54.980
Huh, move?

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:57.310
Choke Sleeper!

00:13:57.560 --> 00:13:58.940
Idiot! Stop!

00:13:59.360 --> 00:14:01.070
Owww!

00:14:02.070 --> 00:14:03.690
How was it? Feel better?

00:14:04.570 --> 00:14:07.820
I'm not depressed because I lost a fight.

00:14:07.820 --> 00:14:09.070
Oh, really?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:13.160
Then what was it you wanted to talk about?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:14.830
Well, it's...

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:18.000
Perhaps you found a girl you like?

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.340
Really, Misao?!

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.590
Who is it? Tell me!

00:14:24.590 --> 00:14:26.260
Someone from your class?

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:28.430
I go to an all boys school.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:29.930
Oh, that's right.

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:32.300
Then someone from a different high school?

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:35.520
If you don't tell me...

00:14:35.810 --> 00:14:37.730
Wrist Twisting Backwards Cross!

00:14:37.730 --> 00:14:40.100
Ok, I'll tell you!

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.020
A girl from Mamoru's class.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:47.400
What?! A girl from Mamoru's class?!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:48.700
How did you meet her?

00:14:49.070 --> 00:14:53.160
I saw Mamoru's class picture, and I fell in love at first sight...

00:14:53.530 --> 00:14:54.790
Love at first sight?!

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.120
You?!

00:14:56.120 --> 00:15:00.080
It's embarassing, so don't you dare tell Mamoru.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.580
Okay, okay.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:04.590
Is it weird for me to fall in love at first sight?

00:15:04.590 --> 00:15:09.470
No, I knew this would happen, and it's cute!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:11.340
So what do you need advice about?

00:15:11.640 --> 00:15:13.600
I gave her a letter, but...

00:15:13.600 --> 00:15:18.270
she told me that she would answer me eventually, so I shouldn't follow her.

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.770
Follow her?

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:24.150
I was worried so I escorted her to and from school...

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:26.480
But she said it was bothersome...

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:28.440
Of course it would be.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.740
If you do something like that when you're not dating the person, you're just a stalker.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:36.160
So from now on, I'll be a bodyguard lurking in the shadows!

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.120
That's being even more stalker-like.

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:42.500
I know, but I can't help it...

00:15:44.040 --> 00:15:45.960
You like her that much?

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.550
What part of her do you like?

00:15:48.550 --> 00:15:51.550
What part? I've never thought about that.

00:15:52.260 --> 00:15:56.220
You like her even though you don't know what part of her you even like?

00:15:56.220 --> 00:15:57.640
Is that weird?

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:00.270
That's more scary than anything.

00:16:00.270 --> 00:16:04.730
Liking someone even though you don't know what part of them you like...

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.820
But isn't that how it's supposed to be?

00:16:07.820 --> 00:16:10.280
Liking someone, that is.

00:16:13.110 --> 00:16:15.200
I wouldn't really know.

00:16:15.570 --> 00:16:18.580
You don't have anyone you like, Misaki?

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:24.370
The whole "liking" or "dating" thing seems kind of annoying, so...

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:26.840
I really don't know.

00:16:26.840 --> 00:16:31.050
So, I won't be able to help you with your problem.

00:16:31.050 --> 00:16:31.800
Sorry.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:32.420
It's okay.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:36.430
Got it? She lives next door, so theres plenty of chances...

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:39.390
Are you just going to waste them?

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:41.020
That's true, but...

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:42.980
It's simple!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.940
Sneak into her yard to steal her panties that are out with the laundry,

00:16:45.940 --> 00:16:47.520
or secretly peek into her bathroom,

00:16:47.520 --> 00:16:49.570
or sneak into her futon...

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:50.980
Those are crimes!

00:16:50.980 --> 00:16:55.570
Okay, okay! I understand! I'll keep it a secret from Mamoru, okay?

00:16:56.200 --> 00:16:58.080
They're keeping a secret from you.

00:16:58.490 --> 00:17:01.950
She can say it to my brother, but not to me?

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:04.580
Am I really that unreliable?

00:17:05.420 --> 00:17:08.340
What're the chances she and your brother have something going on?

00:17:09.380 --> 00:17:11.340
That Misao...

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:17.010
See you later, Mamoru. And Mamoru's friend.

00:17:17.010 --> 00:17:18.930
W-W-W-W-Wait just a minute, onee-san!

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:19.430
Yes?

00:17:19.760 --> 00:17:22.220
Can I have just a moment of your time?

00:17:22.220 --> 00:17:24.520
What are you planning to do, Kusuda-kun?

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.140
It'll be over in a sec.

00:17:26.140 --> 00:17:28.900
Anyway, please have a seat, onee-san!

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:30.110
Okay...

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:37.320
Well then...

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.120
The futon went flying!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:42.040
TL Note: These jokes are known as "dajare". They are used to put the audience to sleep.

00:17:41.080 --> 00:17:42.040
Huh?

00:17:42.450 --> 00:17:44.290
The cat lay down.

00:17:44.290 --> 00:17:47.000
The pig took a hit and fell over.

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.000
Don't say bad jokes!

00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.800
Kitaro came from the north.

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.880
Sorry, I lost to a swimmer.

00:17:53.880 --> 00:17:56.170
The cow laughed saying "ushishi!"

00:17:56.170 --> 00:17:57.800
I can't stand this!

00:17:58.140 --> 00:18:00.390
Super shocked because there's no breakfast!

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:02.560
Winning is full of nutrition!

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:04.890
I ain't answerin' the phone.

00:18:04.890 --> 00:18:07.230
I can ride the monorail now.

00:18:07.600 --> 00:18:10.400
The principal is the best!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.360
How about some squid?

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.700
Saki-nee!

00:18:17.780 --> 00:18:19.320
W-Why?

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:25.000
My jokes have the power to put women to sleep!

00:18:25.000 --> 00:18:27.460
That means they're boring, right?

00:18:27.460 --> 00:18:29.460
Dumbass, don't say it so bluntly.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:30.920
That makes them sound useless, you idiot.

00:18:30.920 --> 00:18:34.710
So now that Saki-nee's asleep, what're you going to do?

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:36.260
Do?

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:37.720
It's our chance!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:41.760
Oh, this angle is too good!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:44.430
No, you can't do that, Kusuda-kun!

00:18:44.430 --> 00:18:46.640
Shh! She'll wake up!

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:49.190
Don't look at Saki-nee with those eyes!

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:50.980
But they were made to see things.

00:18:50.980 --> 00:18:51.940
That's not what I mean!

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:53.570
Shut up!

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:56.070
You can fall in love this way too, can't you?

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:57.440
What do you mean by that?

00:18:57.780 --> 00:19:01.910
We're guys in 8th grade already! Don't lose to reason, Zaitsu!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:05.040
Kusuda-kun, you need to control your primitive instincts!

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:10.790
Zaitsu, you don't feel anything from looking at these thighs? This waist?!

00:19:13.670 --> 00:19:16.920
And those boobs that are just asking to be groped?

00:19:22.680 --> 00:19:23.640
Go, Zaitsu.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.970
This is your chance!

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.270
Saki-nee...

00:19:28.770 --> 00:19:30.770
Ok, go!

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:32.270
I'll follow your lead!

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:36.270
I won't let you lay a hand on my Saki-nee!

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.110
S-Saki-nee

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:46.120
Oh she's hugging you!

00:19:47.450 --> 00:19:50.540
Mysterious Opposite Arm Cross!

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.130
Twist Arm Burn!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.380
Lucky.

00:19:58.800 --> 00:20:03.340
Knee wing... Armlock!

00:20:04.470 --> 00:20:06.810
I want her to put moves on me too!

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:10.770
Crap...

00:20:11.180 --> 00:20:15.190
Choke Sleeper... Hold!

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:23.530
Number Four!

00:20:23.820 --> 00:20:25.530
I give up! Forfeit!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:26.410
Stop!

00:20:26.410 --> 00:20:29.830
That's why I don't want to be just a childhood friend.

00:20:43.800 --> 00:20:47.470
I think onee-san was actually awake...

00:20:47.930 --> 00:20:52.100
No, I think she was probably just having a dream about martial arts.

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:53.310
Good morning, gentlemen!

00:20:56.810 --> 00:20:57.690
Muscle pains?

00:20:58.360 --> 00:21:03.450
No, it's just that my joints are a bit...

00:21:03.780 --> 00:21:06.410
I don't believe it at all.

00:21:06.740 --> 00:21:09.160
It really is yummy!

00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:11.410
Putting sugar on fermented beans just isn't right.

00:21:11.700 --> 00:21:15.420
Just trick yourself into it and try it at least once.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:19.710
It's Misao.

00:21:19.710 --> 00:21:22.630
Oh, what did he want to talk about?

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:25.050
He found a girl he likes.

00:21:25.050 --> 00:21:27.590
What? That Yeti did?

00:21:27.590 --> 00:21:28.760
Yeah...

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:35.850
"I know you told me to stop because it made me look like a stalker, but I got too worried and followed her home."

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:40.320
It must be difficult, liking someone.

00:21:46.070 --> 00:21:49.160
I'm pathetic...

00:21:50.830 --> 00:21:52.160
I...

00:21:52.160 --> 00:21:53.080
Hm?

00:21:54.370 --> 00:21:55.960
It's nothing.

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:58.380
Anyway, why don't we race to school?

00:21:58.710 --> 00:21:59.750
Huh?

00:22:01.250 --> 00:22:03.340
Ready... Go!

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:05.630
Wait!

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.180
Misaki-chan!

00:22:10.100 --> 00:22:14.060
I'm fine without love... for now!

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.150
It's almost the day of Yukinoshita Middle School's athletics competition.

00:23:48.150 --> 00:23:51.110
I, Enomoto Kei, am in charge of the cheering!

00:23:51.110 --> 00:23:53.740
Along with kappa-faced Kusuda!

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:57.040
I wanted to do it with someone who was better looking!

00:23:57.040 --> 00:23:59.250
Because all that matters about guys is looks, right?
